  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Norec, FK Norway, personnell exchange</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Nepal, Brazil, Bangladesh, Kenya, Colombia, Madagascar. Name of project: Interact
The focus for the partnership is developing youth leadership and participation, enabling the partner organisations to benefit from this. For this project period, they seek to focus on providing longlasting engagement of previous Interact participants in their sending organisation. This is deemed important for the project to improve the project itself, as well as to have an impact of youth engagement on an organisational level within all the partner organisations.

Further on a general note, all partners will work according to IFES strategic priorities stated as follows:
1. Strengthening leadership and formation - through leaders of integrity, impacting the church, the university, all of society
2. Addressing current global issues - as students, united with the global body of Christ, responding to contemporary challenges from with a Christian perspective
3. Engaging the university - constructively and boldly, with carefully-developed biblical worldviews, demonstrating the integration of faith, life and academic disciplines</narrative>
  </description>
